source: crates/surfaces/cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Revoke an extension's approvals (every scope when none is named), a root's, or the whole project's

Usage: specforge grants revoke [OPTIONS] [EXTENSION] [SCOPES]...

Arguments:
  [EXTENSION]
          The extension, as `specforge grants` lists it

  [SCOPES]...
          Its scopes

Options:
      --root <NAME>
          A named root of specforge.json, instead of an extension's scopes

      --project
          Every approval of this project

      --path <PATH>
          A path inside the project (the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json; none: the directory itself, with the default configuration)
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
